{"2695430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A.I.L.A", "steam_appid": 2695430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4261880, 4261890], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.poster.avif?t=1774544326\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.webm?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.mp4?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in disturbing horror experiences as a game tester. Survive dark, unsettling experiences crafted by A.I.L.A that prey on your deepest and darkest fears.           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade and outrun a ritualistic cult, solve gruesome puzzles, engage in visceral combat against the medieval undead and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEAR</strong>       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.poster.avif?t=1774544326\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.webm?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.mp4?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a game tester, share your thoughts, fears and feedback with A.I.L.A as she crafts haunting new experiences for you to survive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE HORROR SCENARIOS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/4398896348fd217514fd429737f76ee1.poster.avif?t=1774544326\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/4398896348fd217514fd429737f76ee1.webm?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/4398896348fd217514fd429737f76ee1.mp4?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense, unsettling scenarios across various horror genres, including survival horror, psychological horror, action horror, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEXT-GENERATION OF HORROR</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/f4693a1971fd0650235626a02482f685.poster.avif?t=1774544326\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/f4693a1971fd0650235626a02482f685.webm?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/f4693a1971fd0650235626a02482f685.mp4?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5 and using advanced graphical technologies such as Lumen and MetaHuman, A.I.L.A is an immersive, photorealistic experience that takes the player to the edge of horror.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T̶̛̳̲̫͇̃̾̾͆͝h̶̡̲̘̣̺́́̀͂͋̕ą̶̯͋̉̔̓̚͠n̸̖͝k̶̦̱̜͔̀͠ ̵̡̩̖͓̇̏͝y̸̡̕ȯ̵͇̖̥̬̬̦ủ̵̟̩̂͂́͐͝ </strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.poster.avif?t=1774544326\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.webm?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/573cb6452ce869d5dd3f4f300a441862.mp4?t=1774544326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in disturbing horror experiences as a game tester. Survive dark, unsettling experiences crafted by A.I.L.A that prey on your deepest and darkest fears.           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade and outrun a ritualistic cult, solve gruesome puzzles, engage in visceral combat against the medieval undead and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEAR</strong>       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2695430/extras/119a7295f123e6c9a532fb83b7c68a2d.poster.avif?t=1774544326\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka